{"id":"758dc3e018caf1ed","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-measure3-fubini-integrable-function.md","title":"ZFC Measure3 Fubini Integrable Function","display":"df-zfc-measure3-fubini-integrable-function — ZFC Measure3 Fubini Integrable Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure3-fubini-integrable-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure3-fubini-integrable-function"],"display":"df-zfc-measure3-fubini-integrable-function — ZFC Measure3 Fubini Integrable Function","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure3-fubini-integrable-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure3-fubini-integrable-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure3-fubini-integrable-function — ZFC Measure3 Fubini Integrable Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a8bb827e3e31f34f\" href=\"?note=a8bb827e3e31f34f\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma_X,\\mu,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\nu,f,\\Sigma,\\rho\\in V\">\\(X,\\Sigma_X,\\mu,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\nu,f,\\Sigma,\\rho\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> is the measure predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S\\)</span> is the product-sigma-algebra predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a8bb827e3e31f34f\" href=\"?note=a8bb827e3e31f34f\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\\)</span> is real-valued measurability (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3FubiniIntegrableFunction}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3FubiniIntegrableFunction}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3FubiniIntegrableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma_X,\\mu,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\nu,f)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma_X)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\Sigma_Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\Sigma,\\rho\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\Sigma_X,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\rho,X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma_X\\;\\forall B\\in\\Sigma_Y\\;(\\rho(A\\times B)=\\mu(A)\\nu(B))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}{}\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\\land\\int_{X\\times Y}|f|\\,d\\rho&lt;\\infty\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3FubiniIntegrableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma_X,\\mu,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\nu,f)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma_X)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\Sigma_Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\Sigma,\\rho\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\Sigma_X,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\rho,X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma_X\\;\\forall B\\in\\Sigma_Y\\;(\\rho(A\\times B)=\\mu(A)\\nu(B))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}{}\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\\land\\int_{X\\times Y}|f|\\,d\\rho&lt;\\infty\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8bb827e3e31f34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S$ is the measure predicate (see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8bb827e3e31f34f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S$ is the product-sigma-algebra predicate (see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S$ is real-valued measurability (see [[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma_X,\\mu,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\nu,f,\\Sigma,\\rho\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3FubiniIntegrableFunction}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}integrable\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3FubiniIntegrableFunction}_S(X,\\Sigma_X,\\mu,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\nu,f)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma_X)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\Sigma_Y)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists\\Sigma,\\rho\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\Sigma_X,Y,\\Sigma_Y,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\rho,X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&\\hspace{4em}{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma_X\\;\\forall B\\in\\Sigma_Y\\;(\\rho(A\\times B)=\\mu(A)\\nu(B))\\\\\n&\\hspace{4em}{}\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\\land\\int_{X\\times Y}|f|\\,d\\rho<\\infty\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1738,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2582","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-measure3-fubini-integrable-function.md|58-df-zfc-measure3-fubini-integrable-function]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["bbbec05fde1d3b01","ca832ed6bc22f728","a8bb827e3e31f34f"]}